Alembic migrations for Expo Design AI.

The app also calls db.init_db() (create_all) on startup, so it runs without
migrations during development. To adopt versioned migrations for production:

  1. Start from an empty DB (or `alembic stamp head` on an existing one).
  2. Generate the first migration:  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "initial"
  3. Apply:                          alembic upgrade head

The DB URL comes from EXPO_DATABASE_URL (default: sqlite in ./data/expo.db).
For production, point it at Postgres, e.g.
  EXPO_DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://user:pass@host:5432/expo
